OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after motorcycle crashes
OL,4,Ainto sign
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after a motorcycle
OL,7,Fcrashed into a sign near Market
OL,8,FDeeping.
OL,10,FLincolnshire Police said the collision
OL,11,Fwas reported just before 22:15 BST on
OL,12,FWednesday close to the roundabout
OL,13,Fjunction of the A15 and A1175.
OL,15,FThe rider, a man in his 30s from the
OL,16,FSpalding area, was pronounced dead at
OL,17,Fthe scene, the force said.
OL,19,FOfficers appealed for anyone who saw
OL,20,Fthe collision, or has dashcam footage,
OL,21,Fto contact them.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
